{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"解放軍暫停順豐速運採購參與資格\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CN-PLA-261121-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】解放軍暫停順豐速運的採購參與資格。</p><p>解放軍周六發布軍隊採購暫停名單，當中包括順豐速運及八馬茶業，指他們存在違規問題，被暫停參加全軍物資、工程和服務採購活動，但無說明詳情及暫停期限。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:03:57.963154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:20:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T02:35:14.425705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:57:44.622194+00:00","content_hash":"9d3545e15f8f812832199adb3ed2e5bb38f2eb8227ebe1c9397271e4374d6977","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}